; EnvDock copy. Include after MUI_LANGUAGE declarations.
LangString ENV_WELCOME_TITLE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "EnvDock ${VERSION}$\r$\n本地 API 调试工作台"
LangString ENV_WELCOME_TITLE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "EnvDock ${VERSION}$\r$\nYour local API workbench"
LangString ENV_WELCOME_TEXT ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "让接口调试，更专注一些。$\r$\n$\r$\n多项目 · 多服务 · 多环境管理$\r$\n环境独立域名、请求配置与响应记录$\r$\n切换自动保存，支持 Ctrl+S$\r$\n本地存储、数据导入与历史清理$\r$\n$\r$\n无需云端账户，工作区数据留在本机。$\r$\n$\r$\n点击「下一步」开始安装。"
LangString ENV_WELCOME_TEXT ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Build. Send. Inspect.$\r$\n$\r$\nProjects, services and environments$\r$\nEnvironment-specific requests and responses$\r$\nAutomatic saving, plus Ctrl+S$\r$\nLocal storage, import and data cleanup$\r$\n$\r$\nNo cloud account. Your workspace stays local.$\r$\n$\r$\nChoose Next to get started."
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_TITLE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载 EnvDock"
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_TITLE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall EnvDock"
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_SUBTITLE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "选择保留工作区，或完整清理本机数据。"
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_SUBTITLE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keep your workspace, or remove all managed local data."
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_INFO ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "程序文件、快捷方式和应用注册项将被移除。$\r$\n默认保留本地工作区，方便以后重新安装。"
LangString ENV_UNINSTALL_INFO ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Program files, shortcuts and app registration will be removed.$\r$\nYour local workspace is kept unless you choose full removal."
LangString ENV_PURGE_CHECK ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "完全卸载：同时删除本地工作区数据（不可恢复）"
LangString ENV_PURGE_CHECK ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Full removal: also delete local workspace data (irreversible)"
LangString ENV_PURGE_HELP ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "包括接口、环境配置、请求、响应、凭据、缓存和应用内备份。$\r$\n不删除 Yaak、便携版数据、目录外导出或共享 WebView2。$\r$\n$\r$\n重要数据请先导出到应用数据目录之外。"
LangString ENV_PURGE_HELP ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Includes APIs, environments, requests, responses, credentials, caches and in-app backups.$\r$\nYaak, portable data, exports outside app data and shared WebView2 are not removed.$\r$\nExport important data outside the app data folders first."
LangString ENV_PURGE_CONFIRM ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "确定完整卸载并永久删除 EnvDock 的本地工作区、凭据和备份？$\r$\n此操作不可撤销。未备份的数据无法恢复。"
LangString ENV_PURGE_CONFIRM ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Permanently delete the EnvDock workspace, credentials and managed backups?$\r$\nThis cannot be undone. Unbacked-up data cannot be recovered."
LangString ENV_PURGE_FAILED ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "数据清理未完成，已停止卸载。请关闭 EnvDock 并检查文件占用、目录链接或权限后重试。程序和卸载入口已保留。"
LangString ENV_PURGE_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Data cleanup failed. Uninstall stopped. Close EnvDock and check locked files, directory links or permissions, then retry. The app and uninstaller are retained."
LangString ENV_BINARY_FAILED ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "程序文件无法删除，卸载未完成。请关闭占用程序或检查权限后重试。卸载入口已保留；若已选择清理，已删除的数据无法恢复。"
LangString ENV_BINARY_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The application file could not be removed. Uninstall is incomplete. Close locking processes or check permissions and retry. Uninstall registration is retained; any data already purged cannot be recovered."
